  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for Recovery: Housing restoration and hygiene items support to War-affected households in Kherson Oblast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide immediate assistance to war affected households and support vulnerable categories of the population, ensuring stable and safe living conditions in the city of Kherson.Goal 1: Restore 288 households Kherson within 6 months. Task:1.Formation of three construction teams:&#x2022;Hiring and forming 4 construction teams, each of which consists of 3 employees. Construction crews will be responsible for carrying out restoration work.2.Purchase of building materials:&#x2022;Procurement of necessary materials for household reconstruction, including bricks, cement, wood, roofing materials, windows, doors, and other construction materials.3.Restoration works:&#x2022;Construction crews carry out restoration work in damaged households. Each brigade restores 12 households per month.Goal 2: Provide 1650 hygiene kits to vulnerable populations. Task:1.Purchase of hygiene kits:Purchase of 1650 hygiene kits, including basic hygiene items: soap, shampoo, toothpaste, toothbrushes, towels, feminine hygiene products and other necessary items.2.Identification and registration of vulnerable categories of the population in need of hygiene kits.3.Distribution of hygiene kits</narrative>
  </description>
